{"sha": "84382f1d506f4424322223d0d08fd4af076af545eb4e2260a8ae08608413cf07", "body": ["\\textbf{13.} 对 $\\frac{P'}P = \\sum_k\\frac1{X -", "\\omega^k}$ 求导：", "\\[", "\\frac{P''}P - \\Bigl(\\frac{P'}P\\Bigr)^2", "= -\\sum_{k=1}^{n-1}\\frac1{(X - \\omega^k)^2} .", "\\]", "当 $X = 1$ 时：$P''(1) = \\sum_{j=2}^{n-1}j(j-1) = 2\\binom n3 =", "\\frac{n(n-1)(n-2)}3$（由曲棍球棒恒等式或归纳法），于是", "\\[", "\\sum_{k=1}^{n-1}\\frac1{(1 - \\omega^k)^2}", "= \\Bigl(\\frac{n-1}2\\Bigr)^2 - \\frac{(n-1)(n-2)}3", "= \\frac{(n-1)\\bigl(3(n-1) - 4(n-2)\\bigr)}{12}", "= \\frac{(n-1)(5-n)}{12} .", "\\]", "", "\\textbf{14.} 将第 12 题的公式平方，记 $c_k =", "\\cot\\frac{k\\pi}n$：", "\\[", "\\frac1{(1-\\omega^k)^2}", "= \\Bigl(\\frac12 + \\frac\\iu2 c_k\\Bigr)^2", "= \\frac14 - \\frac{c_k^2}4 + \\frac\\iu2\\,c_k .", "\\]", "求和，并利用 $\\sum c_k = 0$（第 12 题）及第 13 题的结果：", "$\\frac{n-1}4 - \\frac14\\sum_k c_k^2 = \\frac{(n-1)(5-n)}{12}$，于是", "\\[", "\\sum_{k=1}^{n-1}\\cot^2\\frac{k\\pi}n", "= (n-1) - \\frac{(n-1)(5-n)}3 = \\frac{(n-1)(n-2)}3 .", "\\]", "再由 $\\frac1{\\sin^2t} = 1 + \\cot^2t$ 得", "$\\sum_k\\frac1{\\sin^2\\frac{k\\pi}n} = (n-1) +", "\\frac{(n-1)(n-2)}3 = \\frac{n^2-1}3$。", "", "\\textbf{15.} 当 $n = 3$ 时：$\\cot^2\\frac\\pi3 + \\cot^2\\frac{2\\pi}3 =", "\\frac13 + \\frac13 = \\frac23 = \\frac{2\\cdot1}3$；又", "$\\frac1{\\sin^2} $ 之和为 $\\frac43 + \\frac43 = \\frac83 =", "\\frac{9-1}3$。当 $n = 4$ 时：$1 + 0 + 1 = 2 = \\frac{3\\cdot2}3$；又 $2", "+ 1 + 2 = 5 = \\frac{16-1}3$。两式均验证无误。", "", "\\textbf{16.} 对 $t \\in \\intoo0{\\frac\\pi2}$，由经典的", "比较式 $\\sin t < t < \\tan t$（可用面积或凸性论证，", "高中分册中已熟悉），取倒数得 $\\cot t <", "\\frac1t < \\frac1{\\sin t}$，三者在该区间内均为正；两边平方后", "不等号方向不变。令 $t = \\frac{k\\pi}n$，$1 \\leq k \\leq m$，", "$n = 2m+1$（于是 $t < \\frac\\pi2$）：", "\\[", "\\cot^2\\frac{k\\pi}n < \\frac{n^2}{k^2\\pi^2} <", "\\frac1{\\sin^2\\frac{k\\pi}n} .", "\\]", "", "\\textbf{17.} 由对称关系 $\\cot^2\\frac{(n-k)\\pi}n =", "\\cot^2\\frac{k\\pi}n$，对 $\\sin^2$ 同理，第 14 题的两个和", "式减半：$\\sum_{k=1}^{m}\\cot^2\\frac{k\\pi}n = \\frac{(n-1)(n-2)}6 =", "\\frac{m(2m-1)}3$，及 $\\sum_{k=1}^m\\frac1{\\sin^2\\frac{k\\pi}n} =", "\\frac{n^2-1}6 = \\frac{2m(m+1)}3$。对第 16 题在 $k =", "1, \\dots, m$ 上求和，并乘以 $\\frac{\\pi^2}{n^2}$：", "\\[", "\\frac{\\pi^2}{(2m+1)^2}\\cdot\\frac{m(2m-1)}3", "\\;<\\; \\sum_{k=1}^{m}\\frac1{k^2} \\;<\\;", "\\frac{\\pi^2}{(2m+1)^2}\\cdot\\frac{2m(m+1)}3 .", "\\]", "两界均趋于 $\\frac{\\pi^2}6$（当 $m \\to \\infty$ 时，比值", "$\\frac{m(2m-1)}{(2m+1)^2}$ 与 $\\frac{2m(m+1)}{(2m+1)^2}$ 均", "趋于 $\\frac12$），由夹逼原理，单调递增的部分和", "收敛，且", "\\[", "\\sum_{k=1}^{\\infty}\\frac1{k^2} = \\frac{\\pi^2}6 .", "\\]", "", "\\textbf{18.} 将 $\\frac1{X^2-1} = \\frac12\\bigl(\\frac1{X-1} -", "\\frac1{X+1}\\bigr)$ 两边平方：", "\\[", "\\frac1{(X^2-1)^2} = \\frac14\\Bigl(\\frac1{(X-1)^2} +", "\\frac1{(X+1)^2}\\Bigr) - \\frac12\\cdot\\frac1{(X-1)(X+1)} ,", "\\]", "再将交叉项重新分解为 $\\frac1{(X-1)(X+1)} =", "\\frac12\\bigl(\\frac1{X-1} - \\frac1{X+1}\\bigr)$，即得所述", "形式。当 $X = 0$ 时：左边为 $1$；右边为 $\\frac14(1 + 1) -", "\\frac14(-1 - 1) = \\frac12 + \\frac12 = 1$。", "", "\\textbf{19.} 对第 18 题关于 $n \\geq 2$ 求和。记 $S =", "\\sum_{k\\geq1}\\frac1{k^2} = \\frac{\\pi^2}6$：$\\sum_{n\\geq2}", "\\frac1{(n-1)^2} = S$；$\\sum_{n\\geq2}\\frac1{(n+1)^2} = S - 1 -", "\\frac14$；又间隔为 2 的裂项相消 $\\sum_{n\\geq2}\\bigl(", "\\frac1{n-1} - \\frac1{n+1}\\bigr) = 1 + \\frac12 = \\frac32$。由此得", "\\[", "\\sum_{n=2}^{\\infty}\\frac1{(n^2-1)^2}", "= \\frac14\\Bigl(2S - \\frac54\\Bigr) - \\frac14\\cdot\\frac32", "= \\frac S2 - \\frac{11}{16}", "= \\frac{\\pi^2}{12} - \\frac{11}{16} \\approx 0.135 .", "\\]", "数值上：$\\frac19 + \\frac1{64} + \\frac1{225} + \\frac1{576} +", "\\frac1{1225} + \\dots \\approx 0.1111 + 0.0156 + 0.0044 + 0.0017 +", "0.0008 + \\dots \\approx 0.135$：与上式一致。", "", "\\textbf{20.} 对第 8 题的恒等式求导", "$\\sum_k\\frac1{X-\\omega^k} = \\frac{nX^{n-1}}{X^n-1}$：", "\\[", "\\sum_{k=0}^{n-1}\\frac1{(X - \\omega^k)^2}", "= \\frac{n^2X^{2n-2} - n(n-1)X^{n-2}(X^n - 1)}{(X^n - 1)^2} .", "\\]", "验证 $n = 2$，$X = 2$ 时：右边 $\\frac{4\\cdot4 -", "2\\cdot1\\cdot3}{9} = \\frac{10}9$；左边 $\\frac1{(2-1)^2} +", "\\frac1{(2+1)^2} = 1 + \\frac19 = \\frac{10}9$。", "", "\\textbf{21.} $\\frac1{\\binom nk} = \\frac{k!\\,(n-k)!}{n!} =", "\\frac{k!}{(n-k+1)(n-k+2)\\cdots n}$，分母是 $k$ 个", "连续整数的乘积。令 $j = n - k + 1$（于是 $j$ 取遍", "$\\N^*$，$n$ 从 $k$ 起）：", "\\[", "\\sum_{n=k}^{\\infty}\\frac1{\\binom nk}", "= k!\\sum_{j=1}^{\\infty}\\frac1{j(j+1)\\cdots(j+k-1)}", "= \\frac{k!}{(k-1)\\,(k-1)!} = \\frac{k}{k-1} ,", "\\]", "由第 4 题以 $k - 1$ 代替 $k$ 即得（因", "$k - 1 \\geq 1$ 成立）。", ""]}